          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#0f1724;--panel:#0b1220;--accent:#ff6b6b;--muted:#9aa7b2;--card:#0e1622;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif}\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071021 0%,var(--bg) 100%);color:#e6eef6}\\n    .container{max-width:980px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:24px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:54px;height:54px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#ffd66b);border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:#071021}\\n    .navlinks{display:flex;gap:14px}\\n    .navlinks a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}\\n    .navlinks a:hover{background:var(--glass);color:#fff}\\n    header.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:14px}\\n    .hero-left h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 8px;color:#fff}\\n    .eyebrow{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-size:13px}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}\\n    .cta{margin-top:18px}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#071021;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .panel{background:var(--panel);padding:16px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .avatar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\\n    .avatar svg{width:64px;height:64px}\\n    .section{margin-top:22px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}\\n    .pill{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0c1824,rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .pill h4{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .case{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,107,107,0.06),rgba(255,214,107,0.03));padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n    footer.cta{margin-top:28px;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}\\n    .pattern{opacity:0.06;position:absolute;right:12px;top:120px;width:220px;height:220px}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.container{padding:16px}.hero-left h1{font-size:22px}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">W</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"navlinks\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-left\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">About the method</div>\\n        <h1>Structured habit design for sustainable wellness</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I\\u2019m {{COACH_NAME}} ({{CREDENTIALS}}). I blend behavior science, incremental frameworks and measured feedback to help busy people build routines that stick. No fads, only repeatable systems that create momentum.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"cta\\\"><a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n          <!-- unique inline avatar svg for about -->\\n          <svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 120 120\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-label=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"gA1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffd66b\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ff6b6b\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#071826\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"44\\\" r=\\\"22\\\" fill=\\\"url(#gA1)\\\"/>\\n            <rect x=\\\"18\\\" y=\\\"72\\\" width=\\\"84\\\" height=\\\"26\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#0b1622\\\" stroke=\\\"#12232f\\\"/>\\n          </svg>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Lead magnet: a concise 7-day habit primer with quick experiments you can run this week. Delivered as a step-by-step checklist.</div>\\n      </aside>\\n\\n      <!-- unique decorative pattern svg for about -->\\n      <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 200\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <defs><linearGradient id=\\\"pA\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ff6b6b\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffd66b\\\"/></linearGradient></defs>\\n        <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" rx=\\\"24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#pA)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.2\\\" stroke-dasharray=\\\"8 12\\\"/>\\n      </svg>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\" id=\\\"principles\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">How I guide change (simple scaffolds)</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px\\\">I translate broad goals into habit-sized experiments, tracking signals rather than outcomes. Each program uses the same three-step scaffolding below.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n          <h4>1. Map & Measure</h4>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">Map your current routine and the small wins you already have. We design micro-trials you can measure weekly.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n          <h4>2. Build & Anchor</h4>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">Anchor new behaviours to existing cues and protect them with low-friction scaffolds so they survive real life.\\n          </p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n          <h4>3. Iterate with Data</h4>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">Collect simple signals, refine the environment and scale up what consistently works for you.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n          <h4>Principle</h4>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">Small, consistent inputs compound. My work is to make those inputs inevitable.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\" id=\\\"myths\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Common misbeliefs, corrected</h2>\\n      <dl style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">\\n        <dt style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Myth: \\\"Motivation is the solution\\\"</dt>\\n        <dd>Truth: Motivation fluctuates. We design triggers that remove reliance on motivation.</dd>\\n        <dt style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Myth: \\\"One-size-fits-all programs work\\\"</dt>\\n        <dd>Truth: Generic plans ignore context. We test micro-customizations quickly to find what fits your life.</dd>\\n      </dl>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\" id=\\\"work\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Outcome snapshots — case studies</h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n          <strong>Client: Early-career manager</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Reduced evening reactivity and added a 15-minute recovery ritual. After 8 weeks, self-reported stress down, focus windows up.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n          <strong>Client: Parent returning to work</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">Built a morning sequence that combined micro-work and self-care. Achieved consistent two-hour deep work blocks three times a week.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\" id=\\\"faq\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Questions I get often</h2>\\n      <dl class=\\\"faq\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">\\n        <dt>How do you measure progress?</dt>\\n        <dd>I track weekly signal metrics (habit adherence, perceived effort, contextual friction). They predict long term outcomes better than raw goals.</dd>\\n        <dt>Is this medical advice?</dt>\\n        <dd>No. I focus on behavior change and lifestyle systems. For medical questions consult a licensed clinician.</dd>\\n        <dt>What commitment is typical?</dt>\\n        <dd>Most clients commit to a 12-week experimental period to establish routines and collect enough data to iterate effectively.</dd>\\n      </dl>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer class=\\\"cta\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Ready to try a structured experiment?</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px\\\">Start with a short audit call and a 7-day habit primer.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Services — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff7f6;--card:#1b2430;--accent:#2dd4bf;--muted:#56707a;--glass:rgba(27,36,48,0.06);font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#f9fbfa 100%);color:var(--card)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:26px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2dd4bf,#6ee7b7);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#062021;font-weight:800}\\n    nav a{margin-left:16px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{margin-top:18px;padding:20px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(45,212,191,0.06),rgba(102,126,234,0.02))}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}\\n    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\\n    .columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .services{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    .service{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(23,31,41,0.06)}\\n    .service h3{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .aside{position:relative;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#e8fdf8,#fff)}\\n    .cta-btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--accent);color:#042024;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .svg-deco{position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:12px;opacity:0.08}\\n    .faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.svg-deco{display:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\"><div class=\\\"logo\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME.charAt(0)}}</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <h1>Services & methods — pragmatic support</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Short sprints, deep systems work, and ongoing membership support. Pick the frame that suits your availability and desired accountability.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"columns\\\">\\n      <main>\\n        <div class=\\\"services\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <h3>Action Audit (2 hours)</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">A focused session to map stressors and openings. Includes a 7-point action list you can implement immediately.</div>\\n            <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Best for people who need a fast, evidence-based reset without committing to a long program.</p>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta-btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book an audit</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <h3>12-week Habit Lab</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">A structured experimental period: weekly check-ins, micro-trials, and an iterative plan that grows with your wins.</div>\\n            <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">We instrument simple signals and tune your environment so new habits survive the first 6-8 weeks.</p>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta-btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Join the lab</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <h3>Membership: Momentum Room</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Ongoing peer + coach-supported membership for those who want sustained progress without 1:1 intensity.</div>\\n            <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Includes monthly workshops, an accountability dashboard and quarterly audits.</p>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta-btn\\\" href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Explore memberships</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n            <h3>Focused Habit Tune-up</h3>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">A 4-week micro-coaching package to fix one habit quickly using evidence-backed levers.</div>\\n            <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Perfect when one change unlocks multiple others (sleep, focus window, movement).</p>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta-btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Start tune-up</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 6px\\\">Why these frames?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">Different problems need different frames: quick audits for clarity, labs for habit formation, and membership for maintenance. All rely on the same modular toolkit.</p>\\n\\n        <!-- unique inline pattern svg for services -->\\n        <svg class=\\\"svg-deco\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 160 160\\\" width=\\\"140\\\" height=\\\"140\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"sG1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#2dd4bf\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#60a5fa\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <g fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#sG1)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"8\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\">\\n            <path d=\\\"M12 40c30-24 80-24 136 0\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M12 80c30-24 80-24 136 0\\\" opacity=\\\"0.6\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M12 120c30-24 80-24 136 0\\\" opacity=\\\"0.35\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n        </svg>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <strong>Quick FAQ</strong>\\n          <dl class=\\\"faq\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <dt>Can I switch between services?</dt>\\n            <dd>Yes. The modular approach is designed so clients can move from audits to labs to membership as needs change.</dd>\\n            <dt>Are sessions remote?</dt>\\n            <dd>All coaching is remote via video and our shared tracker unless a local in-person arrangement is requested.</dd>\\n          </dl>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"cta-btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Start with an audit</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">\\n      <h2>Debunking two common service misconceptions</h2>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">I focus on changeable inputs, not promises. Expect real experiments, small wins, and measurable learning even if the outcome takes time.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:22px;padding:18px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Ready to pick a frame?</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Schedule a 20-minute clarity call to choose the right starting point.</div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta-btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Schedule clarity call</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"programs.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Programs — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#071430;--card:#0b1a2a;--accent:#ffb86b;--muted:#9fb4c3;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#051225 0%,#071430 100%);color:#eaf6ff}\\n    .site{max-width:980px;margin:36px auto;padding:22px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    .nav a{color:var(--muted);margin-left:14px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .hero{margin-top:18px;padding:22px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,184,107,0.06),rgba(255,107,107,0.02))}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:26px}\\n    .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .price{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px}\\n    .cta{margin-top:12px}\\n    .faq dt{font-weight:700;margin-top:12px}\\n    .case{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,184,107,0.04),transparent);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .svg-hero{width:100%;height:140px;margin-top:12px}\\n    @media(max-width:980px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"site\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n      <nav class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Pricing</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"testimonials.html\\\">Testimonials</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <h1>Memberships & cohorts built for momentum</h1>\\n      <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0\\\">Choose between cohort-driven growth, lightweight membership, or an intensive 1:1 membership. All programs emphasize measurable habit change over inspiration-only approaches.</p>\\n\\n      <!-- unique hero svg for programs -->\\n      <svg class=\\\"svg-hero\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 200\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <defs>\\n          <linearGradient id=\\\"pg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffb86b\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ff6b6b\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n        </defs>\\n        <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#041123\\\" />\\n        <g fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#pg)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\">\\n          <path d=\\\"M40 140c80-120 210-60 300-20s180 60 360-40\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\" />\\n          <circle cx=\\\"100\\\" cy=\\\"80\\\" r=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#0b2030\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#pg)\\\" />\\n        </g>\\n      </svg>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"layout\\\">\\n      <section id=\\\"tiers\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px\\\">Program lanes — pick the pace</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"cards\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h3>Starter Cohort: \\\"Micro Wins\\\"</h3>\\n            <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0\\\">8-week cohort focused on one behavior at a time. Weekly short lessons + two group check-ins.</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\">$149 — cohort access</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"cta\\\"><a style=\\\"background:var(--accent);color:#071225;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Join cohort</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h3>Momentum Membership: \\\"Room\\\"</h3>\\n            <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0\\\">Monthly membership with workshops, community labs, and an accountability dashboard. Great for steady ongoing progress.</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\">$39/mo — membership</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"cta\\\"><a style=\\\"background:var(--accent);color:#071225;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Become a member</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h3>Foundations 1:1: \\\"Deep System\\\"</h3>\\n            <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0\\\">Intensive coaching for complex transitions: weekly 1:1s, prioritized habits, and direct email support.</p>\\n            <div class=\\\"price\\\">Membership plus 1:1 (custom)</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"cta\\\"><a style=\\\"background:var(--accent);color:#071225;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Request proposal</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section id=\\\"case-studies\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:12px 0 8px\\\">Real outcomes</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"case\\\">\\n          <strong>Remote leader</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0\\\">Moved from reactive to scheduled deep work by installing a daily mini-routine. After 10 weeks they reclaimed six hours of focused work per week.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"case\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <strong>New parent</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0\\\">Built micro-restorative rituals and a short evening anchor. Progress was measurable and low-friction, increasing restful time without extensive schedule changes.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section id=\\\"pillars\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:12px 0 8px\\\">Core pillars that every program uses</h2>\\n        <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0;padding-left:18px;line-height:1.6\\\">\\n          <li>Signal-based measurement instead of absolute goals</li>\\n          <li>Low-friction anchors and environmental nudges</li>\\n          <li>Iterative micro-trials (1-week experiments)</li>\\n        </ul>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section id=\\\"myth-truth\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:12px 0 8px\\\">What this is not</h2>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">It\\u2019s not fast fixes or feel-good only advice. Programs are built for cumulative improvement and designed to work within real-world constraints.</p>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section id=\\\"faq\\\">\\n        <h2 style=\\\"margin:12px 0 8px\\\">Program questions</h2>\\n        <dl class=\\\"faq\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">\\n          <dt>How long before I see improvement?</dt>\\n          <dd>Small signal improvements often appear in 2-4 weeks; reliable habit consolidation usually takes 8-12 weeks depending on context and consistency.</dd>\\n          <dt>Are there refunds?</dt>\\n          <dd>Cohort and membership terms vary; cohort fees are typically non-refundable after the start date while memberships can be canceled monthly.</dd>\\n          <dt>Do you accept corporate clients?</dt>\\n          <dd>Yes. I design scaled programs for teams; contact me via the contact page for proposals.</dd>\\n        </dl>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <footer style=\\\"margin-top:18px;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">Start with a clarity call</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">We\\u2019ll map one small experiment you can run this week.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <a style=\\\"background:var(--accent);color:#071225;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </footer>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <!-- unique avatar svg for programs page -->\\n    <svg style=\\\"display:none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" id=\\\"program-avatar\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 120 120\\\">\\n      <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" rx=\\\"16\\\" fill=\\\"#061426\\\"/>\\n      <g transform=\\\"translate(12,12)\\\">\\n        <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"96\\\" height=\\\"96\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#0b2030\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"34\\\" cy=\\\"34\\\" r=\\\"20\\\" fill=\\\"#ffb86b\\\"/>\\n        <rect x=\\\"18\\\" y=\\\"58\\\" width=\\\"60\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" rx=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"#091726\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
